WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.900
The president of the United States has had
a tweet flagged by Twitter because it is encouraging

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:10.140
people not to vote by telling them things
that are not true about Corona virus.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.309
This is incredible.

00:00:11.309 --> 00:00:16.770
The sitting president of the United States
is violating the terms of service of a social

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:21.279
media platform, not for something unrelated
to his election, but because he is spreading

00:00:21.279 --> 00:00:25.119
disinformation about his own upcoming reelection.

00:00:25.119 --> 00:00:32.220
Donald Trump tweeted, quote, So now the Democrats
are using mail drop boxes, which are a voter

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.410
security disaster.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:37.210
Now, of course, these are municipalities using
the boxes.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:38.710
It's not Democrats.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:42.899
Trump goes on to say, among other things,
they make it possible for for a person to

00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:44.079
vote multiple times.

00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:45.760
Also, who controls them?

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:49.149
Are they placed in Republican or Democrat
areas?

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:51.420
They are not corvids sanitized.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.899
A big fraud.

00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:54.670
And rightly, Twitter.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:59.860
Put the message up on the tweet, which says
this tweet violated the Twitter rules about

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.969
civic and election integrity.

00:01:02.969 --> 00:01:05.420
So there are really two parts here.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:11.310
The first is Donald Trump is continuing to
say that vote by mail, absentee Dropbox's,

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:12.829
none of it is secure.

00:01:12.829 --> 00:01:13.969
This is not true.

00:01:13.969 --> 00:01:15.490
Trump is saying that without evidence.

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:17.670
I'm sure you know that by now.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:22.799
Part two of this is this new idea of playing
on people's fears of corona virus by saying,

00:01:22.799 --> 00:01:27.979
you know, the drop boxes for the ballots,
they're not coded, sanitized.

00:01:27.979 --> 00:01:32.530
And this is a clear attempt to dissuade Biden
voters.

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:33.959
How do we know that?

00:01:33.959 --> 00:01:39.249
Because Biden voters we know are taking coronavirus
more seriously than our Trump voters.

00:01:39.249 --> 00:01:44.630
Biden voters are more likely to be planning
to vote by mail to avoid maybe catching Corona

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:46.630
virus at a polling place.

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:50.349
Biden voters are more likely to wear masks
when they go outside.

00:01:50.349 --> 00:01:56.289
So we know that if you start spreading the
idea, the ballot Dropbox might give you the

00:01:56.289 --> 00:01:57.289
virus.

00:01:57.289 --> 00:02:01.359
You are going to disproportionately hit Biden
voters.

00:02:01.359 --> 00:02:08.239
But it could backfire if Democrats are more
likely not to believe what Trump says.

00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:12.069
And Trump voters are more likely to believe
what Donald Trump says.

00:02:12.069 --> 00:02:15.459
It's conceivable that this idea of saying,
you know, you could get coronavirus from the

00:02:15.459 --> 00:02:16.540
Dropbox.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:19.269
It might end up keeping his own voters at
home.

00:02:19.269 --> 00:02:24.920
I don't think in the end it will have a hugely
disproportionate impact one way or the other.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:28.860
But Twitter is completely correct to flag
his tweet and to put a warning on it.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:32.930
Donald Trump is terrified that people are
going to come out and vote in huge numbers

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:34.599
and not for him, but for the other guy.

00:02:34.599 --> 00:02:37.900
And in fact, the entire Republican Party is
terrified of that.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:43.209
I expect that as the election gets closer,
Trump is going to be going even crazier and

00:02:43.209 --> 00:02:44.680
pulling out all the stops.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.420
Everything will be on the table.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:48.590
We have to make sure it backfires.

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:54.730
We have to keep publicizing that he's doing
this because there's one thing we know.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.470
People will be more determined to vote.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:00.569
The more they realize Trump doesn't want them
to.

00:03:00.569 --> 00:03:02.230
People are just like that by nature.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:05.659
The post office was a turning point for many
Americans.

00:03:05.659 --> 00:03:09.590
Sending troops into cities was a turning point
for many Americans.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:11.019
This is a cult.

00:03:11.019 --> 00:03:12.470
It's a dangerous one.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:19.969
And a lot of people, understandably, would
crawl over broken glass to vote in November.

00:03:19.969 --> 00:03:23.989
The president of the United States is trying
to suppress the vote.

00:03:23.989 --> 00:03:29.420
Obviously, he should have long ago been banned
from Twitter, regularly bullying people, breaking

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:31.359
just about every term and condition they have.

00:03:31.359 --> 00:03:32.879
But this is bigger than Twitter.

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:36.739
Mail in ballots or bad ballot drop boxes could
be infected with coronavirus.

00:03:36.739 --> 00:03:38.189
We have to stop it.

00:03:38.189 --> 00:03:39.519
We have to stop it.

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:41.520
And you listen.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.520
Let's skip it.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:04:11.889
You know what

00:04:11.889 --> 00:04:58.500
you have

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:58.930
to do.

